When attempting to install readxl in Alpine Linux, the package fails to compile.  There's a bit of a twist to this one though -- this is running inside an [Apptainer](https://github.com/apptainer/apptainer) image, which might cause differing behaviour to a "normal" system.

This was discovered when attempting to install tidyverse, hence the lack of dependencies when installing only readxl (in the output below).

What are the required libraries for tidyverse?  It is possible that I'm missing one or more, I was lacking iconv a while ago, which was solved by compiling and installing from source.


